## 4. Phase 2 Pre-Promotion Validation Gate

Before promoting data from Staging (`staging.stg_*`) to Production tables (`public.*`), the following SQL verification assertions must pass with 0 errors:

```sql
-- Assertion 1: Exact Route Count Preservation
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM staging.stg_routes; -- Must equal 315
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM public.routes;      -- Must equal 315

-- Assertion 2: Exact Stop Count Preservation (All 12,909 Stops Retained)
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM staging.stg_route_stops; -- Must equal 12909
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM public.route_stops;      -- Must equal 12909

-- Assertion 3: Exact Trip Count Preservation
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM staging.stg_trips; -- Must equal 3547
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM public.trips;      -- Must equal 3547

-- Assertion 4: Strict Referential Integrity
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM public.trips WHERE route_id NOT IN (SELECT route_id FROM public.routes); -- Must be 0

-- Assertion 5: Unverified Fare Safety (Zero SQL NULL Bypass)
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM public.trips 
WHERE fare_verification_status = 'UNVERIFIED' AND fare_amount IS NOT NULL; -- Must be 0

-- Assertion 6: Consecutive Duplicate Flag Count (63 pairs / 126 records flagged, 0 deleted)
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM public.route_stops WHERE is_consecutive_duplicate = TRUE; -- Must equal 126

-- Assertion 7: Route Breakdown of Consecutive Duplicate Records
SELECT route_id, COUNT(*) 
FROM public.route_stops 
WHERE is_consecutive_duplicate = TRUE 
GROUP BY route_id;
-- Must match:
-- Route 6710: 2 records (1 pair)
-- Route 6908: 72 records (36 pairs)
-- Route 6866: 52 records (26 pairs)

-- Assertion 8: Trip Status Code Distribution
SELECT trip_status_code, COUNT(*) 
FROM public.trips 
GROUP BY trip_status_code;
-- Must match:
-- Code 0: 2,085
-- Code 2: 1,237
-- Code 6: 218
-- Code 9: 7

-- Assertion 9: Distance Fare Matrix Slabs
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM public.fare_stage_rates; -- Must equal 32

-- Assertion 10: Row 32 Long-Distance Unspecified Base Fare Check
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM public.fare_stage_rates 
WHERE stage_number = 32 
  AND adult_base_fare_inr IS NULL 
  AND government_max_fare_inr = 30.00; -- Must equal 1
```

