## 5. Rollback & Recovery Strategy

If any assertion fails during Phase 2:
1. All staging-to-production promotion scripts execute inside an atomic transaction block (`BEGIN ... ROLLBACK`).
2. Staging tables reside in schema `staging` and can be safely truncated and reloaded without affecting raw source assets or existing production tables.
3. Raw source assets in `data/raw/` remain completely untouched throughout the entire ingestion and promotion process.
